<title>USA: IHOP Corp July same store sales up.</title>
<headline>IHOP Corp July same store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>GLENDALE, Calif. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>IHOP Corp said Thursday that same store sales for the fiscal month of July 1997, were up 2.3 percent compared to the same period last year.</p>
</text>
